cff-version: 1.2.0
title: Microtubule-Stars
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-10-22
authors:
  - family-names: Lee
    given-names: Mun Seok
license: AGPL-3.0-only
repository-code: https://github.com/sparkainlp-x
abstract: >-
  A holographic brain under a slow cosmic drive: a ring of
  Kuramoto phase oscillators carrying a holographic
  phase-pattern memory, modulated by a slow
  stellar-pulsation-style oscillation (model, not data).
  Measures that unstructured cross-scale modulation degrades
  recall monotonically, with no phase locking and no resonance.
  Includes a research note on five candidate
  microtubule-to-star linkages with status and falsifiers.
  Stdlib-only Python, classical throughout.
keywords:
  - holographic-memory
  - kuramoto
  - cross-frequency-coupling
  - microtubules
  - orch-or
  - wave-computing
